          "stem": "The polynomial \\(2x^3-5x^2-16x+24\\) has zeroes \\(\\alpha,\\beta\\) and \\(\\gamma\\).\n\nWhat is the value of \\(\\alpha\\beta\\gamma(\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma)\\) ?",
          "hint": "Sum = −b/a, product = −d/a for a cubic.",
          "steps": [
